Package: gtk4-brotway
Version: ${DEB_VERSION}
Architecture: ${ARCH}
Maintainer: Lev Gorodetskii <github@drsr.io>
Section: libs
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/droserasprout/gtk-brotway
Depends: ${RUNTIME_PKGS}
Replaces: ${RUNTIME_PKGS}, gtk4-broadway-fork
Conflicts: gtk4-broadway-fork
Provides: gtk4-broadway-fork
Description: GTK ${GTK_VERSION} Broadway backend (brotway fork)
 Patched libgtk-4 shared object plus the gtk4-broadwayd daemon for the
 Broadway backend, filling in its missing pieces (clipboard, touch, zoom,
 cursors, HiDPI, reconnect, rendering fixes) and repointing the
 libgtk-4.so.1 SONAME link at them. Overlays libgtk-4-1 / libgtk-4-bin
 (Depends + Replaces), leaving the rest of apt's GTK (gir, common, ...)
 untouched.
